### Description
Updated the tax calculation endpoint to support regional VAT rules. I also cleaned up the formatting on the user authentication module since the indentation was bugging me.

### Compatibility Rules (from ERP API Governance)
- Adding a new optional property to a request body is COMPATIBLE.
- Adding a new required property to a request body is BREAKING.
- Changing the data type of an existing property is BREAKING.
- Removing a property from a response body is BREAKING.
- Adding a new property to a response body is COMPATIBLE.

### API Changes
**Before:**
```typescript
interface CalculateTaxRequest {
  subtotal: number;
  regionCode: string;
}

interface CalculateTaxResponse {
  totalTax: number;
  grandTotal: number;
}
```

**After:**
```typescript
interface CalculateTaxRequest {
  subtotal: number;
  regionCode: string;
  vatCategory?: string; // Optional, falls back to 'STANDARD'
}

interface CalculateTaxResponse {
  totalTax: number;
  grandTotal: number;
  taxBreakdown: Record<string, number>; // Provides itemized taxes
}
```

