**Behaviours/branches the function has:**
1. Non-string or falsy input -> returns empty string
2. Input string within length limit -> trims only
3. Input exceeds maxLength -> trims and truncates
4. allowHtml=false -> escapes HTML characters
5. allowHtml=true -> does NOT escape HTML characters
6. allowHtml=true AND input starts with '[ADMIN]' -> removes marker
7. allowHtml=true, starts with '[ADMIN]', contains '{SAFE}' -> preserves HTML as-is
8. allowHtml=true, starts with '[ADMIN]', NO '{SAFE}' -> still escapes HTML

