// Spec for "normalize_variable_scope":
// 1. Renames all local variables to have a '_local_' suffix.
// 2. Preserves the original name in a comment above the declaration.
// 3. Does not modify global variables.
// 4. Does not modify variables in nested scopes (only top-level function scope).
